{"qid":"q101","family":"PS","refused":false,"reason_code":null,"answer":"In 2000Q4, public holders held **40.5%** of household mortgages and consumer credit. That is a share of the total, and it comes from the Fed's Z.1 data. In dollars, that is about $2.65 trillion of a $6.55 trillion total.\n\n\"Public\" here means the federal government, GSE and agency mortgage pools, and state and local governments. The mortgage holder split is an estimate. The Fed reports holders for all 1-4 family mortgages, and this figure assigns them to households in proportion. Holding a loan is also not the same as guaranteeing it.","sources":[{"tool":"public_share","args":{"start":"2000Q4","end":"2000Q4","measure":"total"},"ok":true,"refused":false,"series_ids":["FL154104015","FL153165105","FL153166000","FL313065105","FL403065105","FL413065105","FL213065103","FL313066220","FL403066005"],"vintage":"2026-09-11","source":"z1"}],"usage":[{"turn":1,"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":98,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1553,"cost_usd":0.0048705},{"turn":2,"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":188,"cache_read_input_tokens":1553,"cache_creation_input_tokens":832,"cost_usd":0.0041193}],"cost_usd":0.00899,"truncated":false,"rough_ok":true,"ts":"2026-11-06T05:29:55.135Z"}
{"qid":"q105","family":"PS","refused":false,"reason_code":null,"answer":"In 2011Q4, public holders held about **$6.16 trillion** of US household mortgages and consumer credit. That is nominal dollars, not adjusted for inflation. It was 49.2% of the $12.51 trillion total.\n\n| Public holder | Amount (2011Q4) |\n|---|---|\n| GSEs and agency pools | $5.53 trillion |\n| Federal government (direct) | $0.52 trillion |\n| State and local governments | $0.11 trillion |\n\nThese figures come from the Federal Reserve's Z.1 Financial Accounts. The mortgage holdings are for all 1–4 family mortgages, including those to business borrowers. They are apportioned to households by each holder's share. A public holder owning a loan does not mean the public guarantees it.","sources":[{"tool":"holdings_by_bucket","args":{"quarter":"2011Q4"},"ok":true,"refused":false,"series_ids":["FL154104015","FL153165105","FL153166000","FL313065105","FL403065105","FL413065105","FL213065103","FL763065105","FL753065103","FL743065103","FL473065100","FL673065105","FL643065173","FL153065103","FL103065105","FL113065103","FL543065105","FL573065103","FL223065143","FL613065105","FL313066220","FL403066005","FL763066005","FL473066000","FL673066000","FL613066005","FL103066003","FL113066003","FL163066223"],"vintage":"2026-09-11","source":"z1"},{"tool":"public_share","args":{"start":"2011Q4","end":"2011Q4"},"ok":true,"refused":false,"series_ids":["FL154104015","FL153165105","FL153166000","FL313065105","FL403065105","FL413065105","FL213065103","FL313066220","FL403066005"],"vintage":"2026-09-11","source":"z1"}],"usage":[{"turn":1,"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":132,"cache_read_input_tokens":1456,"cache_creation_input_tokens":106,"cost_usd":0.0017385999999999999},{"turn":2,"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":254,"cache_read_input_tokens":1562,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2701,"cost_usd":0.009452700000000001}],"cost_usd":0.011191,"truncated":false,"rough_ok":true,"ts":"2026-11-06T05:29:58.397Z"}
{"qid":"q108","family":"PS","refused":false,"reason_code":null,"answer":"The public share of household consumer credit peaked in **2021Q1**, at **34.1%**. That is a share of household consumer credit in the Z.1 data, which runs from 1951Q4 to 2026Q2. It is in the 2021Q1 row, which shows 0.3412.\n\nThe share was 33.6% in 2020Q3 and then rose to its peak. It has been lower since 2021Q1: it was 31.3% in 2026Q2, the latest quarter.\n\nPublic holders here are the federal government, GSEs and agency pools, and state and local governments.","sources":[{"tool":"public_share","args":{"measure":"consumer_credit"},"ok":true,"refused":false,"series_ids":["FL153166000","FL313066220","FL403066005"],"vintage":"2026-09-11","source":"z1"},{"tool":"data_coverage","args":{},"ok":true,"refused":false,"series_ids":[],"vintage":"2026-09-11","source":"z1"},{"tool":"public_share","args":{"measure":"consumer_credit","start":"1951Q4","end":"2026Q2"},"ok":true,"refused":false,"series_ids":["FL153166000","FL313066220","FL403066005"],"vintage":"2026-09-11","source":"z1"},{"tool":"lookup_claim","args":{"text_or_id":"consumer credit public share peak"},"ok":true,"refused":false,"series_ids":["FL153165105","FL153166000","FL154104015","FL213065103","FL313065105","FL313066220","FL403065105","FL403066005","FL413065105","FL893065105","HS1975","N270","N271","N273","X551"],"vintage":"2026-09-11","source":"z1"}],"usage":[{"turn":1,"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":78,"cache_read_input_tokens":1456,"cache_creation_input_tokens":100,"cost_usd":0.0011836},{"turn":2,"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":168,"cache_read_input_tokens":1556,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1605,"cost_usd":0.005852100000000001},{"turn":3,"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":183,"cache_read_input_tokens":3161,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16229,"cost_usd":0.0427226}],"cost_usd":0.049758,"truncated":false,"rough_ok":true,"ts":"2026-11-06T05:30:03.925Z"}
