{"qid":"q113","family":"PS","refused":false,"reason_code":null,"answer":"Public holders held about **$4.65 trillion** of household 1-4 family mortgages in 2007Q4. This is nominal dollars at the end of the quarter, from the Z.1 Financial Accounts.\n\nThat total adds three groups:\n- GSEs and agency pools: $4.55T\n- State and local governments: $0.08T\n- Federal government, direct: about $0.01T\n\nThis was 43.9% of household mortgages, shown as a share.\n\nZ.1 reports holders for all 1-4 family mortgages, including those of business borrowers. It then apportions them to households, so this is a method rather than a published Z.1 household split.","sources":[{"tool":"holdings_by_bucket","args":{"quarter":"2007Q4"},"ok":true,"refused":false,"series_ids":["FL154104015","FL153165105","FL153166000","FL313065105","FL403065105","FL413065105","FL213065103","FL763065105","FL753065103","FL743065103","FL473065100","FL673065105","FL643065173","FL153065103","FL103065105","FL113065103","FL543065105","FL573065103","FL223065143","FL613065105","FL313066220","FL403066005","FL763066005","FL473066000","FL673066000","FL613066005","FL103066003","FL113066003","FL163066223"],"vintage":"2026-09-11","source":"z1"},{"tool":"public_share","args":{"measure":"mortgage","start":"2007Q4","end":"2007Q4"},"ok":true,"refused":false,"series_ids":["FL153165105","FL893065105","FL313065105","FL403065105","FL413065105","FL213065103"],"vintage":"2026-09-11","source":"z1"}],"usage":[{"turn":1,"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":157,"cache_read_input_tokens":1456,"cache_creation_input_tokens":106,"cost_usd":0.0019886},{"turn":2,"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":253,"cache_read_input_tokens":1562,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2647,"cost_usd":0.0093077}],"cost_usd":0.011296,"truncated":false,"rough_ok":true,"ts":"2026-11-06T05:30:08.012Z"}
{"qid":"q119","family":"HB","refused":false,"reason_code":null,"answer":"In 2026Q2, the GSE/agency bucket held about **$8.98 trillion**. That is nominal US dollars at the end of the quarter, from Z.1 data.\n\n- All of it is mortgages. The bucket holds $0 of consumer credit.\n- That is 47.0% of the $19.10 trillion total for household 1–4 family mortgages plus consumer credit. This is a share of that total.\n\nMortgage holdings are reported for all 1–4 family mortgages, including those of business borrowers. They are apportioned to households by each holder's share.","sources":[{"tool":"holdings_by_bucket","args":{"quarter":"2026Q2"},"ok":true,"refused":false,"series_ids":["FL154104015","FL153165105","FL153166000","FL313065105","FL403065105","FL413065105","FL213065103","FL763065105","FL753065103","FL743065103","FL473065100","FL673065105","FL643065173","FL153065103","FL103065105","FL113065103","FL543065105","FL573065103","FL223065143","FL613065105","FL313066220","FL403066005","FL763066005","FL473066000","FL673066000","FL613066005","FL103066003","FL113066003","FL163066223"],"vintage":"2026-09-11","source":"z1"},{"tool":"data_coverage","args":{},"ok":true,"refused":false,"series_ids":[],"vintage":"2026-09-11","source":"z1"}],"usage":[{"turn":1,"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":84,"cache_read_input_tokens":1456,"cache_creation_input_tokens":113,"cost_usd":0.0012760999999999998},{"turn":2,"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":183,"cache_read_input_tokens":1569,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2763,"cost_usd":0.008898399999999999}],"cost_usd":0.010174,"truncated":false,"rough_ok":true,"ts":"2026-11-06T05:30:11.344Z"}
{"qid":"q122","family":"HB","refused":false,"reason_code":null,"answer":"Private-label securitization, together with mortgage REITs, held its largest share in **2007Q2**, at about **23.0%** (0.2301) of household mortgages and consumer credit. That was about $2.94T. The figures are from the Federal Reserve's Z.1 accounts.\n\nI didn't scan every quarter. I checked 2005Q4, 2006Q2, 2006Q4, 2007Q1, 2007Q2, 2007Q3, 2007Q4 and 2008Q1, and 2007Q2 was the highest of those.\n\n| Quarter | Share |\n|---|---|\n| 2007Q1 | 23.0% |\n| 2007Q2 | 23.0% |\n| 2007Q3 | 22.4% |\n| 2007Q4 | 21.5% |\n| 2008Q1 | 20.9% |\n\nThe 2007Q1 share was 22.96%, just below the 2007Q2 figure. The 2007Q4 share is the project's validated figure. The 2007Q2 figure comes straight from the data but isn't a registered claim.\n\nI didn't check 2006Q3 or any quarter between 2008Q2 and 2026Q2. Across the 2007Q4–2011Q4 window the share fell sharply (12.5 percentage points), so a later peak is unlikely.","sources":[{"tool":"data_coverage","args":{},"ok":true,"refused":false,"series_ids":[],"vintage":"2026-09-11","source":"z1"},{"tool":"lookup_claim","args":{"text_or_id":"private-label securitization peak share"},"ok":true,"refused":false,"series_ids":["(+","(Z.1)","FL153165105","FL153166000","FL154104015","FL643065173","FL673065105","FL673066000","FL893065105","as","bucket","holder","metric's","series)","table","the"],"vintage":"2026-09-11","source":"z1"},{"tool":"crisis_windows","args":{"metric":"share:private_securitization"},"ok":true,"refused":false,"series_ids":["FL154104015","FL313065105","FL403065105","FL413065105","FL213065103","FL763065105","FL753065103","FL743065103","FL473065100","FL673065105","FL643065173","FL153065103","FL103065105","FL113065103","FL543065105","FL573065103","FL223065143","FL613065105","FL313066220","FL403066005","FL763066005","FL473066000","FL673066000","FL613066005","FL103066003","FL113066003","FL163066223"],"vintage":"2026-09-11","source":"z1"},{"tool":"holdings_by_bucket","args":{"quarter":"2007Q4"},"ok":true,"refused":false,"series_ids":["FL154104015","FL153165105","FL153166000","FL313065105","FL403065105","FL413065105","FL213065103","FL763065105","FL753065103","FL743065103","FL473065100","FL673065105","FL643065173","FL153065103","FL103065105","FL113065103","FL543065105","FL573065103","FL223065143","FL613065105","FL313066220","FL403066005","FL763066005","FL473066000","FL673066000","FL613066005","FL103066003","FL113066003","FL163066223"],"vintage":"2026-09-11","source":"z1"},{"tool":"holdings_by_bucket","args":{"quarter":"2007Q2"},"ok":true,"refused":false,"series_ids":["FL154104015","FL153165105","FL153166000","FL313065105","FL403065105","FL413065105","FL213065103","FL763065105","FL753065103","FL743065103","FL473065100","FL673065105","FL643065173","FL153065103","FL103065105","FL113065103","FL543065105","FL573065103","FL223065143","FL613065105","FL313066220","FL403066005","FL763066005","FL473066000","FL673066000","FL613066005","FL103066003","FL113066003","FL163066223"],"vintage":"2026-09-11","source":"z1"},{"tool":"holdings_by_bucket","args":{"quarter":"2007Q3"},"ok":true,"refused":false,"series_ids":["FL154104015","FL153165105","FL153166000","FL313065105","FL403065105","FL413065105","FL213065103","FL763065105","FL753065103","FL743065103","FL473065100","FL673065105","FL643065173","FL153065103","FL103065105","FL113065103","FL543065105","FL573065103","FL223065143","FL613065105","FL313066220","FL403066005","FL763066005","FL473066000","FL673066000","FL613066005","FL103066003","FL113066003","FL163066223"],"vintage":"2026-09-11","source":"z1"},{"tool":"holdings_by_bucket","args":{"quarter":"2008Q1"},"ok":true,"refused":false,"series_ids":["FL154104015","FL153165105","FL153166000","FL313065105","FL403065105","FL413065105","FL213065103","FL763065105","FL753065103","FL743065103","FL473065100","FL673065105","FL643065173","FL153065103","FL103065105","FL113065103","FL543065105","FL573065103","FL223065143","FL613065105","FL313066220","FL403066005","FL763066005","FL473066000","FL673066000","FL613066005","FL103066003","FL113066003","FL163066223"],"vintage":"2026-09-11","source":"z1"},{"tool":"holdings_by_bucket","args":{"quarter":"2007Q1"},"ok":true,"refused":false,"series_ids":["FL154104015","FL153165105","FL153166000","FL313065105","FL403065105","FL413065105","FL213065103","FL763065105","FL753065103","FL743065103","FL473065100","FL673065105","FL643065173","FL153065103","FL103065105","FL113065103","FL543065105","FL573065103","FL223065143","FL613065105","FL313066220","FL403066005","FL763066005","FL473066000","FL673066000","FL613066005","FL103066003","FL113066003","FL163066223"],"vintage":"2026-09-11","source":"z1"},{"tool":"holdings_by_bucket","args":{"quarter":"2006Q4"},"ok":true,"refused":false,"series_ids":["FL154104015","FL153165105","FL153166000","FL313065105","FL403065105","FL413065105","FL213065103","FL763065105","FL753065103","FL743065103","FL473065100","FL673065105","FL643065173","FL153065103","FL103065105","FL113065103","FL543065105","FL573065103","FL223065143","FL613065105","FL313066220","FL403066005","FL763066005","FL473066000","FL673066000","FL613066005","FL103066003","FL113066003","FL163066223"],"vintage":"2026-09-11","source":"z1"},{"tool":"holdings_by_bucket","args":{"quarter":"2006Q2"},"ok":true,"refused":false,"series_ids":["FL154104015","FL153165105","FL153166000","FL313065105","FL403065105","FL413065105","FL213065103","FL763065105","FL753065103","FL743065103","FL473065100","FL673065105","FL643065173","FL153065103","FL103065105","FL113065103","FL543065105","FL573065103","FL223065143","FL613065105","FL313066220","FL403066005","FL763066005","FL473066000","FL673066000","FL613066005","FL103066003","FL113066003","FL163066223"],"vintage":"2026-09-11","source":"z1"},{"tool":"holdings_by_bucket","args":{"quarter":"2005Q4"},"ok":true,"refused":false,"series_ids":["FL154104015","FL153165105","FL153166000","FL313065105","FL403065105","FL413065105","FL213065103","FL763065105","FL753065103","FL743065103","FL473